<p>This work is the result of NIH funding, in whole or in part, and is subject to the NIH Public Access Policy. Through acceptance of this federal funding, the NIH has been given a right to make the work publicly available in PubMed Central. We thank Anne Moon for providing <em>Tbx3<sup>fl/fl</sup></em> mice. We thank the UT Southwestern Metabolic Phenotyping Core for the analysis of plasma and liver triglycerides and cholesterol, plasma free fatty acids, plasma ALT and AST, and lipoprotein fractionation; the UT Southwestern Tissue Management Shared Resource for processing and embedding tissue for histology; the Whole Brain Microscopy Facility (RRID:SCR017949) for access to the scanners used to scan histology and immunohistochemistry slides; the UT Southwestern Quantitative Light Microscopy Core for access to its spinning disk confocal microscope; and Sihan Wu and Yoon Jung Kim at the Children’s Research Institute Sequencing Core for sequencing. GM was supported by a CPRIT training grant (RP210041). GQ was supported by an NIH T32 grant (T32AI005284). HZ is supported by the UT Southwestern Nutrition Obesity Research Center, the Moody Foundation, the NIH (DP1DK139976, 1R01CA251928, P30CA142543), and a Simmons Comprehensive Cancer Center Cancer and Obesity Translational Pilot Award.</p></section><section id="notes1"><section id="sec34"><h3 class="pmc_sec_title">Version 1. 07/10/2025</h3>
